WEBVTT

00:00:00.060 --> 00:00:03.480
<b>Mysterious Discovery Club</b>

00:00:01.640 --> 00:00:03.480
Members of the Mysterious Discovery Club.

00:00:03.480 --> 00:00:10.690
<b>MDC activities 
for the rest of the year</b>

00:00:03.770 --> 00:00:06.270
Our activities for the year end today.

00:00:06.270 --> 00:00:10.690
Take it easy for the rest of the year 
to build up strength for next year.

00:00:10.990 --> 00:00:11.570
Yes, sir!

00:00:12.030 --> 00:00:14.070
Let's meet again in the new year.

00:00:14.070 --> 00:00:14.820
Yes, sir!

00:00:15.280 --> 00:00:17.280
Have a good New Year!

00:00:21.580 --> 00:00:24.330
<i>And so, the second semester ended.</i>

00:00:24.750 --> 00:00:25.570
<b>Merry Christmas!</b>

00:00:24.750 --> 00:00:25.570
<b>Okame 
Sauce</b>

00:00:30.050 --> 00:00:32.340
<i>Christmas passed.</i>

00:00:35.340 --> 00:00:37.050
<b>It's Nearly the 
New Year!</b>

00:00:35.340 --> 00:00:37.050
<b>Okame 
Sauce</b>

00:00:37.340 --> 00:00:39.010
That was miserable.

00:00:39.010 --> 00:00:39.930
Yeah.

00:00:40.430 --> 00:00:42.520
The only remaining event of the year

00:00:42.520 --> 00:00:46.650
is the countdown at Tsurukameyama Shrine.

00:00:46.650 --> 00:00:49.110
About that...

00:00:49.110 --> 00:00:51.110
W-We wondered if...

00:00:51.610 --> 00:00:55.110
Ruru-san might wanna come with us this year.

00:00:55.110 --> 00:00:57.620
What? You want to bring Rurumo to the shrine?

00:00:57.620 --> 00:00:58.660
Yeah, yeah.

00:00:58.660 --> 00:01:00.370
Oh, good idea.

00:01:00.370 --> 00:01:01.450
If Ruru-san's coming,

00:01:01.450 --> 00:01:02.910
I'll cancel my other plans.

00:01:02.910 --> 00:01:03.870
Wow!

00:01:03.870 --> 00:01:06.040
Your schedule's packed with plans with girls!

00:01:06.750 --> 00:01:08.330
Way to go, Sakurai...

00:01:08.330 --> 00:01:10.290
So, how about it, Shiba?

00:01:11.880 --> 00:01:13.340
A shrine visit, huh?

00:01:13.800 --> 00:01:14.720
Okay.

00:01:14.720 --> 00:01:15.470
I'll ask her.

00:01:15.470 --> 00:01:16.590
Really?

00:01:16.590 --> 00:01:17.720
That's great.

00:01:17.720 --> 00:01:19.510
We're counting on you, Shiba!

00:01:19.510 --> 00:01:21.260
Leave it to me!

00:01:23.770 --> 00:01:24.660
<b>Shibaki</b>

00:01:28.480 --> 00:01:29.520
There.

00:01:30.230 --> 00:01:31.900
What are you doing?

00:01:31.900 --> 00:01:32.780
This?

00:01:32.780 --> 00:01:34.940
I'm getting ready for New Year's.

00:01:34.940 --> 00:01:37.610
This year's almost over.

00:01:37.610 --> 00:01:38.990
New Year's?

00:01:39.200 --> 00:01:41.120
I'm preparing for the start of the new year.

00:01:42.330 --> 00:01:43.490
I see.

00:01:43.950 --> 00:01:47.290
Actually, before that, 
there's a New Year's Eve event...

00:01:48.370 --> 00:01:52.250
Sorry, but could you two go on a shopping run for me?

00:01:52.250 --> 00:01:53.000
Sure.

00:01:53.000 --> 00:01:54.000
Leave it to us.

00:02:03.720 --> 00:02:05.680
Hey, Rurumo!

00:02:06.050 --> 00:02:07.390
Let's go!

00:02:07.390 --> 00:02:08.480
Got it.

00:02:10.020 --> 00:02:11.860
The town looks very festive.

00:02:11.860 --> 00:02:13.360
Yeah.

00:02:13.360 --> 00:02:14.860
This is the end of the year.

00:02:14.860 --> 00:02:15.940
Ah.

00:02:18.820 --> 00:02:20.780
Do you remember this place?

00:02:21.320 --> 00:02:23.490
It's where we first met.

00:02:34.840 --> 00:02:37.970
I feel like we've been together 
a long time since then,

00:02:37.970 --> 00:02:40.380
but it hasn't even been a year yet.

00:02:40.890 --> 00:02:44.390
We had a lot of fun, going to the 
beach and mountains and stuff, huh?

00:02:44.660 --> 00:02:46.890
Because of that, her training's goin' nowhere.

00:02:48.120 --> 00:02:49.350
I'm sorry.

00:02:49.580 --> 00:02:51.580
Why are you apologizin'?

00:02:51.580 --> 00:02:53.280
It's the idiot's fault!

00:02:53.280 --> 00:02:55.820
Ya gotta use yer tickets more!

00:02:57.290 --> 00:02:59.490
Well, I'd love to help, but...

00:02:59.730 --> 00:03:01.740
No, it's my fault.

00:03:02.700 --> 00:03:04.700
I've been having so much fun here,

00:03:05.020 --> 00:03:07.100
I lost track of time.

00:03:07.630 --> 00:03:08.950
I've been enjoying myself too much.

00:03:11.750 --> 00:03:14.710
<b>Nishimachi Street Shopping Center
End of Year Sale</b>

00:03:11.750 --> 00:03:14.710
<b>Mochi Making Event
New Year's Soba</b>

00:03:15.600 --> 00:03:18.760
Rurumo, I was gonna ask earlier,

00:03:18.760 --> 00:03:20.670
but on New Year's Eve...

00:03:25.600 --> 00:03:30.560
<b>Kimonos for Rent 
(Long-sleeved)</b>

00:03:26.340 --> 00:03:27.440
A painting?

00:03:27.440 --> 00:03:29.450
It's real pretty.

00:03:31.080 --> 00:03:33.560
This isn't a painting. It's a kimono.

00:03:33.560 --> 00:03:34.540
A kimono?

00:03:34.540 --> 00:03:35.290
Yeah.

00:03:35.290 --> 00:03:37.880
Girls wear them for celebrations like New Year's

00:03:37.880 --> 00:03:39.320
or coming of age ceremonies.

00:03:39.950 --> 00:03:42.200
You can wear this?

00:03:43.460 --> 00:03:44.660
Wanna try one on?

00:03:50.080 --> 00:03:53.060
<b>Kimonos for Rent 
(Long-sleeved)</b>

00:05:34.020 --> 00:05:35.680
That's not nearly enough.

00:05:36.280 --> 00:05:37.600
No choice, I guess.

00:05:37.600 --> 00:05:39.400
I'll have to borrow some from Seitaro...

00:05:39.400 --> 00:05:40.560
No, no, no, no.

00:05:40.560 --> 00:05:42.650
If Mom finds out, she'll kill me.

00:05:43.060 --> 00:05:44.440
In that case...

00:05:45.830 --> 00:05:47.550
No, I can't!

00:05:47.550 --> 00:05:49.910
If I use the tickets, it won't be a surprise!

00:05:52.150 --> 00:05:54.370
I decided to surprise her.

00:05:55.800 --> 00:05:57.040
Okay!

00:05:57.040 --> 00:05:58.330
That's what I'll do!

00:05:59.890 --> 00:06:01.340
I'm off!

00:06:01.800 --> 00:06:03.580
Take care!

00:06:04.670 --> 00:06:09.030
<i>The idiot's been goin' out 
somewhere every day lately.</i>

00:06:09.030 --> 00:06:10.760
<i>I wonder where he's goin'.</i>

00:06:12.300 --> 00:06:14.110
<i>Well, whatever.</i>

00:06:15.220 --> 00:06:16.680
<b>Soba</b>

00:06:16.680 --> 00:06:18.640
<b>Duck       Hanamaki        Kitsune       Tanuki       Chilled 
Soba           Soba               Soba          Soba            Soba</b>

00:06:17.150 --> 00:06:18.640
Welcome.

00:06:25.730 --> 00:06:27.690
<b>Kimonos for Rent 
(Long-sleeved)</b>

00:06:32.070 --> 00:06:33.890
I still don't have enough.

00:06:35.910 --> 00:06:37.330
In that case...

00:06:40.370 --> 00:06:43.250
<b>December 30th</b>

00:06:41.710 --> 00:06:43.250
<i>It's nearly time.</i>

00:06:43.880 --> 00:06:44.750
<i>I'm ready.</i>

00:06:45.630 --> 00:06:47.540
<i>It's just a cheap rental,</i>

00:06:47.540 --> 00:06:50.530
<i>but Rurumo never asks for anything,
so this'll make her happy!</i>

00:06:50.530 --> 00:06:52.760
<i>Planning stuff like this is nice.</i>

00:06:53.280 --> 00:06:55.550
<i>Tomorrow's the shrine visit...</i>

00:06:55.550 --> 00:06:57.520
<i>You don't know it yet, but you'll be going...</i>

00:06:58.190 --> 00:07:00.890
<i>In this long-sleeved kimono!</i>

00:07:01.850 --> 00:07:04.110
<i>I wonder what face she'll make!</i>

00:07:04.710 --> 00:07:06.570
<i>Oh, man, this is nuts...</i>

00:07:06.950 --> 00:07:09.420
<i>I'm even more excited than I thought!</i>

00:07:09.420 --> 00:07:11.360
<i>I already told the guys about it, too!</i>

00:07:11.360 --> 00:07:13.820
<i>What? You have a Ruru-san 
surprise for the shrine visit?</i>

00:07:14.130 --> 00:07:16.910
Man, I'm so excited!

00:07:17.960 --> 00:07:18.960
<i>No, no!</i>

00:07:18.960 --> 00:07:20.290
<i>I need to wait until tomorrow.</i>

00:07:20.630 --> 00:07:22.860
<i>After all, this is a surprise.</i>

00:07:29.370 --> 00:07:33.830
<i>I owe her this for not helping with her training.</i>

00:07:33.830 --> 00:07:36.470
<i>I wish I could help, but if I did...</i>

00:07:37.610 --> 00:07:40.010
<i>Sorry, Rurumo.</i>

00:07:41.510 --> 00:07:44.150
Mama-san is telling us to help her clean.

00:07:45.690 --> 00:07:47.000
Hey!

00:07:47.000 --> 00:07:48.490
Don't come in here!

00:07:48.490 --> 00:07:49.860
Did you see? Did you see that?

00:07:50.150 --> 00:07:51.590
Did you see it? Did you see?

00:07:51.590 --> 00:07:52.740
Did you see anything?

00:07:53.520 --> 00:07:54.680
No.

00:07:55.800 --> 00:07:57.080
That's fine, then...

00:07:57.440 --> 00:08:00.480
Yeah, I actually got you something you'll like—

00:08:01.640 --> 00:08:05.490
Just kidding! I can't say anything else!

00:08:06.480 --> 00:08:07.960
You're awfully excited...

00:08:08.210 --> 00:08:09.710
<i>It'll all happen tomorrow...</i>

00:08:09.920 --> 00:08:13.680
<i>Tomorrow morning, you'll be surprised and excited!</i>

00:08:27.520 --> 00:08:29.800
We're having hot pot tonight!

00:08:29.800 --> 00:08:31.980
There's nothing special about it.

00:08:31.980 --> 00:08:33.960
Come on, let's eat.

00:08:33.960 --> 00:08:35.320
<i>Next is the weather.</i>

00:08:33.960 --> 00:08:35.320
Let's eat.

00:08:35.320 --> 00:08:38.830
<b>Clear skies
 tomorrow 
for New 
Year's Eve</b>

00:08:35.970 --> 00:08:37.840
<i>Skies will be clear tomorrow for New Year's Eve.</i>

00:08:37.840 --> 00:08:41.600
<i>Shrines are expected to be crowded as 
everyone makes their first visit of the year.</i>

00:08:41.600 --> 00:08:43.790
<i>Various transportation facilities will be...</i>

00:08:42.490 --> 00:08:45.220
Kota, you're going tomorrow, right?

00:08:46.650 --> 00:08:47.580
Yeah...

00:08:49.370 --> 00:08:50.630
With Nishino and the guys.

00:08:51.040 --> 00:08:52.250
Just boys?

00:08:52.250 --> 00:08:54.400
Huh? Uh, yeah...

00:08:54.400 --> 00:08:56.120
Hm? How suspicious.

00:08:56.120 --> 00:08:57.300
Wh-What's suspicious?

00:08:59.790 --> 00:09:02.920
The hot and cold sensation of eating ice cream

00:09:02.920 --> 00:09:05.600
while sitting under a kotatsu is great.

00:09:05.890 --> 00:09:06.820
Yes.

00:09:06.820 --> 00:09:09.730
The functionality of this desk futon is laudable.

00:09:10.120 --> 00:09:11.600
Desk futon?

00:09:12.240 --> 00:09:14.840
Oh... You mean the kotatsu.

00:09:14.840 --> 00:09:16.410
Desk futon, huh?

00:09:16.650 --> 00:09:18.850
That's a funny way to put it.

00:09:28.140 --> 00:09:31.550
Kota, there's something I want to tell you.

00:09:31.970 --> 00:09:32.590
Huh?

00:09:33.420 --> 00:09:34.590
Tomorrow...

00:09:35.640 --> 00:09:38.390
What about tomorrow?

00:09:53.000 --> 00:09:54.990
You fell asleep under the kotatsu again.

00:09:56.640 --> 00:10:00.340
I've told you not to sleep under 
the kotatsu. You'll catch a cold.

00:10:01.200 --> 00:10:05.160
Once I get in, I can't leave the desk futo—

00:10:05.470 --> 00:10:06.810
Huh?

00:10:06.810 --> 00:10:08.790
What was I about to say?

00:10:10.580 --> 00:10:11.790
Breakfast's ready.

00:10:13.610 --> 00:10:14.500
Okay.

00:10:17.480 --> 00:10:18.260
Huh?

00:10:18.630 --> 00:10:20.740
Isn't something missing?

00:10:20.740 --> 00:10:22.250
What are you talking about?

00:10:22.250 --> 00:10:24.470
Your father already left.

00:10:24.470 --> 00:10:26.640
Oh, right...

00:10:26.640 --> 00:10:28.270
Come on, let's eat.

00:10:28.270 --> 00:10:29.350
Let's eat.

00:10:30.820 --> 00:10:33.480
I'd better go to work once I finish eating.

00:10:33.480 --> 00:10:35.730
Wait, why am I working?

00:10:36.220 --> 00:10:39.700
That reminds me. Don't forget to 
return the money I lent you.

00:10:40.520 --> 00:10:41.660
Money?

00:10:43.120 --> 00:10:45.900
Huh? Why did I lend you money?

00:10:46.650 --> 00:10:47.860
Well, whatever.

00:10:47.860 --> 00:10:50.420
Anyway, are you heading to 
the shrine right after work?

00:10:50.780 --> 00:10:51.640
Yeah.

00:10:51.640 --> 00:10:53.630
I'm meeting the guys tonight.

00:10:54.200 --> 00:10:57.260
You won't attack any girls, will you?

00:10:57.870 --> 00:10:59.880
I-I wouldn't attack anyone!

00:10:59.880 --> 00:11:01.260
Why would you even worry about that?

00:11:01.880 --> 00:11:06.250
That's the kind of thing a group of four boys 
at the peak of puberty would do.

00:11:06.250 --> 00:11:09.160
Hey! Is that something a mother should say?

00:11:09.160 --> 00:11:12.270
Promise me you won't attack any girls.

00:11:12.630 --> 00:11:15.230
I won't attack any girls!

00:11:19.600 --> 00:11:21.450
Girls, huh?

00:11:22.230 --> 00:11:27.660
I feel like I was really looking forward to 
something having to do with a girl...

00:11:27.660 --> 00:11:30.010
<b>Rurumo</b>

00:11:30.010 --> 00:11:31.500
<b>Rurumo</b>

00:11:31.880 --> 00:11:36.140
Rurumo? I thought we used this room for storage.

00:11:39.340 --> 00:11:40.260
Hello?

00:11:41.150 --> 00:11:42.580
Sugawara?

00:11:42.580 --> 00:11:44.180
Huh? The library?

00:11:45.100 --> 00:11:46.100
Got it.

00:11:46.100 --> 00:11:47.500
I'll bring it later.

00:11:48.270 --> 00:11:48.970
Sure.

00:11:48.970 --> 00:11:52.940
<b>Rurumo</b>

00:11:49.610 --> 00:11:51.070
Yeah, got it.

00:11:51.600 --> 00:11:52.620
Later.

00:11:53.810 --> 00:11:57.980
A Day Without Rurumo

00:12:08.200 --> 00:12:09.250
Good work, everyone!

00:12:09.250 --> 00:12:10.500
Have a good New Year!

00:12:14.980 --> 00:12:16.250
It's so cold.

00:12:20.360 --> 00:12:21.590
What is this?

00:12:29.110 --> 00:12:29.640
Huh?

00:12:30.640 --> 00:12:31.720
This place...

00:12:43.120 --> 00:12:45.110
I was dying to see you, Shiba!

00:12:45.570 --> 00:12:48.240
You're pretty psyched up, Sugawara.

00:12:48.240 --> 00:12:49.920
I understand, though.

00:12:49.920 --> 00:12:51.390
Here, for the new year.

00:12:51.390 --> 00:12:52.500
Thanks.

00:12:54.620 --> 00:12:55.830
Thanks a bunch.

00:12:55.830 --> 00:12:57.550
It's fine.

00:12:57.550 --> 00:12:59.330
What's up, Nishino?

00:12:59.330 --> 00:13:01.300
You said you had a surprise.

00:13:02.730 --> 00:13:04.010
A surprise?

00:13:04.300 --> 00:13:05.030
Yeah.

00:13:05.030 --> 00:13:07.720
Knowing you, I figured it must 
have to do with a girl...

00:13:07.720 --> 00:13:10.050
Like a girl in a kimono!

00:13:10.050 --> 00:13:12.520
Yeah, I thought we'd get 
to see her in a kimono!

00:13:13.150 --> 00:13:14.020
Who?

00:13:17.310 --> 00:13:19.270
Huh? What was her name?

00:13:19.790 --> 00:13:21.400
You know, <i>her</i>.

00:13:21.400 --> 00:13:23.170
The idol-like...

00:13:23.590 --> 00:13:25.520
Wait, that's weird. I can't remember her name.

00:13:26.620 --> 00:13:28.990
Aren't you guys talking about Ruru-san?

00:13:29.330 --> 00:13:30.750
Sakurai!

00:13:30.750 --> 00:13:32.740
Look, it says "Ruru-san" here.

00:13:32.740 --> 00:13:34.450
Museum with Mari-chan
Shopping with Yukari-san
Café with Keiko-chan
Movie with Karen-chan
Shrine visit with Ruru-san
New Year's Day
Drive with Mariko-san

00:13:33.400 --> 00:13:34.450
Ruru-san?

00:13:34.900 --> 00:13:36.760
Was that her name?

00:13:39.620 --> 00:13:42.840
<b>Rurumo</b>

00:13:39.680 --> 00:13:40.700
<i>That's right!</i>

00:13:40.700 --> 00:13:42.840
<i>That sign said "Rurumo"...</i>

00:13:43.560 --> 00:13:47.150
Sakurai, do you know who Ruru-san is?

00:13:47.150 --> 00:13:48.320
No.

00:13:48.320 --> 00:13:49.850
What? But it says...

00:13:50.560 --> 00:13:52.170
It's strange.

00:13:52.640 --> 00:13:55.100
If I wrote her name down, 
it must've been really special,

00:13:55.520 --> 00:13:57.870
but I can't remember anything.

00:13:59.370 --> 00:14:00.610
<i>This is weird...</i>

00:14:03.400 --> 00:14:05.440
<i>Something's been weird since this morning.</i>

00:14:05.490 --> 00:14:08.700
<b>Rurumo</b>

00:14:06.680 --> 00:14:08.060
<i>Who is she?</i>

00:14:08.890 --> 00:14:11.200
<b>West Park</b>

00:14:13.470 --> 00:14:14.660
Hey, Shiba.

00:14:15.320 --> 00:14:17.400
Let's take a shortcut to the shrine.

00:14:17.400 --> 00:14:18.120
Sure.

00:14:18.120 --> 00:14:20.630
There's no New Year's food like fried chicken.

00:14:20.630 --> 00:14:21.080
Fried chicken?

00:14:21.420 --> 00:14:23.340
I've never heard of fried chicken for New Year's.

00:14:22.330 --> 00:14:23.340
No way! You've never had it?

00:14:23.750 --> 00:14:25.090
Seriously?

00:14:25.090 --> 00:14:26.050
<i>This place...</i>

00:14:26.430 --> 00:14:28.100
<i>Who did I come here with?</i>

00:14:28.620 --> 00:14:32.000
<i>I think I came here with... someone...</i>

00:14:33.160 --> 00:14:34.140
<i>What just...</i>

00:14:35.610 --> 00:14:36.600
<i>Huh?</i>

00:14:37.100 --> 00:14:39.960
<i>What was that? I thought...</i>

00:14:39.960 --> 00:14:41.810
Hey, Shiba!

00:14:42.410 --> 00:14:43.690
Oh, sorry!

00:14:46.520 --> 00:14:47.570
<i>I thought...</i>

00:14:47.910 --> 00:14:50.160
<i>she looked familiar...</i>

00:14:54.030 --> 00:14:56.440
<b>New Year's Countdown
Tsurukameyama Shrine New Year's Event Committee</b>

00:14:55.820 --> 00:14:57.590
Whoa...

00:14:58.300 --> 00:15:00.130
Check out this line.

00:15:00.130 --> 00:15:02.710
Let's line up later and get our fortunes first.

00:15:03.050 --> 00:15:04.470
Okay, don't rush!

00:15:04.470 --> 00:15:06.210
Move forward slowly, everyone.

00:15:06.650 --> 00:15:09.930
There's no need to hurry.
The shrine isn't going anywhere.

00:15:10.900 --> 00:15:11.990
It's the lady cop!

00:15:11.990 --> 00:15:15.100
Lady cop!

00:15:15.100 --> 00:15:17.810
You! Don't break the line!

00:15:18.130 --> 00:15:20.200
Oh, it's you boys.

00:15:20.200 --> 00:15:21.690
Yeah, it's us.

00:15:22.680 --> 00:15:24.230
Where's that girl?

00:15:24.720 --> 00:15:25.860
What girl?

00:15:26.270 --> 00:15:28.610
You know, the one who's always with you...

00:15:28.610 --> 00:15:31.740
Um, you know... that girl.

00:15:32.000 --> 00:15:33.850
Always with me?

00:15:33.850 --> 00:15:35.740
I don't have a girlfriend.

00:15:35.740 --> 00:15:37.700
I wonder who she was, then.

00:15:39.150 --> 00:15:40.640
<i>The lady cop, too...</i>

00:15:43.540 --> 00:15:45.290
<b>Shrine Office</b>

00:15:47.260 --> 00:15:48.860
I thought it was a shrine maiden,

00:15:48.860 --> 00:15:50.630
but it's the student monitor!

00:15:51.140 --> 00:15:53.090
I know it's not a good look on me!

00:15:53.090 --> 00:15:55.320
Actually, I'm digging it.

00:15:55.320 --> 00:15:56.050
What?

00:15:56.420 --> 00:15:59.310
You look great in uniforms, Inoue.

00:15:59.310 --> 00:16:01.360
A-Are you up to something?

00:16:01.360 --> 00:16:03.350
If you're not here for your fortunes, then leave!

00:16:03.350 --> 00:16:06.190
Why are you a shrine maiden, anyway?

00:16:06.670 --> 00:16:10.380
The head priest knows my dad, 
and he asked me to help.

00:16:12.160 --> 00:16:13.820
But it's almost my break,

00:16:13.820 --> 00:16:15.320
so I'll be changing out of this.

00:16:15.320 --> 00:16:16.850
Senpai!

00:16:17.700 --> 00:16:18.670
Hey!

00:16:18.960 --> 00:16:20.850
You guys are here, too?

00:16:20.850 --> 00:16:22.470
Listen to this, Senpai.

00:16:22.470 --> 00:16:26.630
I wanted to visit the shrine 
with the president, but...

00:16:26.870 --> 00:16:28.180
<i>Would you like to go?</i>

00:16:28.180 --> 00:16:29.090
<i>No, thank you.</i>

00:16:29.090 --> 00:16:31.450
He turned me down...

00:16:29.570 --> 00:16:35.220
<b>GLOOM</b>

00:16:31.450 --> 00:16:32.600
Tanako-chan.

00:16:32.600 --> 00:16:34.090
Keep it together.

00:16:34.090 --> 00:16:35.220
That's right.

00:16:35.540 --> 00:16:36.580
I'm fine.

00:16:36.580 --> 00:16:39.430
I have my other president with me!

00:16:40.820 --> 00:16:42.330
<i>What courage...</i>

00:16:42.330 --> 00:16:44.790
Inoue's going on break.

00:16:44.790 --> 00:16:46.190
Why don't we go together?

00:16:46.880 --> 00:16:48.040
Thanks for waiting.

00:16:48.040 --> 00:16:49.410
Shall we go?

00:16:49.410 --> 00:16:50.900
Could I have a moment?

00:16:51.310 --> 00:16:53.920
Since we all ran into each other,

00:16:53.920 --> 00:16:56.990
let me give you these photos 
from the other day.

00:16:56.990 --> 00:16:58.910
They came out pretty well,

00:16:58.910 --> 00:17:00.620
so I decided to print some.

00:17:02.450 --> 00:17:11.590
<b>Ruru-san LOVE</b>

00:17:02.800 --> 00:17:04.330
They're of the band.

00:17:04.330 --> 00:17:06.830
Yeah, when Shiba sang with that horrible voice.

00:17:06.830 --> 00:17:07.840
Shut up!

00:17:07.840 --> 00:17:10.200
Aw, my eyes are closed...

00:17:11.590 --> 00:17:12.670
Huh?

00:17:13.800 --> 00:17:16.130
This girl in the middle...

00:17:16.360 --> 00:17:17.570
Who is she?

00:17:17.570 --> 00:17:19.620
Why is she in the picture?

00:17:20.160 --> 00:17:21.010
But...

00:17:21.320 --> 00:17:23.350
I don't think I've seen her before,

00:17:23.350 --> 00:17:26.270
but she seems really familiar, for some reason...

00:17:26.540 --> 00:17:28.170
Come to think of it...

00:17:29.010 --> 00:17:34.080
I'm amazed we made it to the 
third round with your awful voice.

00:17:31.150 --> 00:17:35.070
<b>Tsurukameyama</b>

00:17:31.150 --> 00:17:35.070
<b>Countdown</b>

00:17:40.560 --> 00:17:42.540
Ouch...

00:17:43.180 --> 00:17:44.790
Are you okay, Shiba?

00:17:45.160 --> 00:17:47.060
Yeah, I'm fine.

00:17:47.640 --> 00:17:49.790
Actually, I feel like

00:17:50.330 --> 00:17:53.680
I've forgotten something really important.

00:17:54.130 --> 00:17:55.590
<b>Kota</b>

00:17:58.800 --> 00:18:00.270
I see.

00:18:00.270 --> 00:18:02.430
He was talking about this.

00:18:03.620 --> 00:18:04.620
That fool.

00:18:08.840 --> 00:18:10.310
<b>Tsurukameyama</b>

00:18:08.840 --> 00:18:10.310
<b>Countdown</b>

00:18:10.640 --> 00:18:13.090
Whew, sorry!

00:18:13.090 --> 00:18:14.190
I'm fine now.

00:18:14.440 --> 00:18:16.120
Shall we go?

00:18:16.120 --> 00:18:17.100
Huh?

00:18:17.650 --> 00:18:19.880
You dropped something.

00:18:21.040 --> 00:18:21.770
Here.

00:18:22.480 --> 00:18:24.240
Thanks, Sawashita-san.

00:18:33.920 --> 00:18:35.920
<i>Something's missing.</i>

00:18:36.240 --> 00:18:39.180
<i>Something really important is missing...</i>

00:18:41.680 --> 00:18:44.590
<i>If it's bothering me this much,</i>

00:18:44.590 --> 00:18:45.810
<i>it must be a girl.</i>

00:18:46.160 --> 00:18:47.100
<i>But...</i>

00:18:47.100 --> 00:18:48.810
<i>It's gone.</i>

00:18:48.810 --> 00:18:51.730
<i>It must have something to do with her.</i>

00:18:53.620 --> 00:18:57.690
<i>I've forgotten about a really important girl...</i>

00:18:58.010 --> 00:18:59.140
Sorry.

00:19:08.720 --> 00:19:10.250
<i>That kimono...</i>

00:19:11.760 --> 00:19:15.210
You prepared this foolish thing for me,

00:19:15.210 --> 00:19:17.120
so I decided to wear it.

00:19:19.630 --> 00:19:20.630
Ten,

00:19:20.630 --> 00:19:21.630
nine,

00:19:21.630 --> 00:19:23.640
eight, seven,

00:19:23.640 --> 00:19:24.640
six,

00:19:24.640 --> 00:19:26.600
five, four,

00:19:26.600 --> 00:19:27.600
three,

00:19:27.600 --> 00:19:28.600
two,

00:19:28.600 --> 00:19:29.600
one,

00:19:29.600 --> 00:19:31.850
zero!

00:19:32.520 --> 00:19:33.610
Rurumo!

00:19:37.360 --> 00:19:39.360
Ruru...mo...

00:19:39.680 --> 00:19:40.860
That's right.

00:19:40.860 --> 00:19:41.860
It's me.

00:19:42.950 --> 00:19:44.200
<i>I remember...</i>

00:19:45.960 --> 00:19:48.160
<i>There's something I want to tell you.</i>

00:19:48.160 --> 00:19:50.450
<i>I have an inspection tomorrow.</i>

00:19:50.450 --> 00:19:54.060
<i>Once a year, someone from the 
spirit world administrative bureau</i>

00:19:54.060 --> 00:19:57.080
<i>will check on the progress of my training.</i>

00:19:57.080 --> 00:19:58.310
<i>That's it...</i>

00:19:58.310 --> 00:20:01.120
<i>However, in order to prevent 
any interference from me,</i>

00:20:01.120 --> 00:20:04.440
<i>you'll be put under a spell to 
temporarily freeze your memories.</i>

00:20:04.440 --> 00:20:05.730
<i>That's why...</i>

00:20:05.730 --> 00:20:08.400
<i>Everyone's memories of me will be erased.</i>

00:20:08.400 --> 00:20:11.550
<i>For one day out of every 365,</i>

00:20:11.550 --> 00:20:14.150
<i>I will disappear from your minds.</i>

00:20:16.880 --> 00:20:20.250
<i>That's why I didn't remember!</i>

00:20:20.900 --> 00:20:22.320
Wow!

00:20:23.820 --> 00:20:26.050
Wh-What was that?

00:20:26.500 --> 00:20:28.240
It is what you call a "reaction."

00:20:28.810 --> 00:20:32.750
Weren't you going to surprise me with this kimono?

00:20:32.960 --> 00:20:34.710
Y-Yeah...

00:20:35.500 --> 00:20:38.620
So I showed you my surprised reaction.

00:20:39.730 --> 00:20:42.250
Yeah! You look great.

00:20:42.250 --> 00:20:43.340
I see.

00:20:43.340 --> 00:20:44.300
Hey!

00:20:44.920 --> 00:20:46.550
I'm the one who put it on her!

00:20:45.570 --> 00:20:46.550
<b>Heh!</b>

00:20:46.860 --> 00:20:49.130
Chiro, you're here, too?

00:20:49.130 --> 00:20:50.290
Sure am.

00:20:52.280 --> 00:20:53.480
<i>That's right.</i>

00:20:54.470 --> 00:20:55.420
Rurumo...

00:20:56.230 --> 00:20:58.570
It's a p-pre—

00:20:58.570 --> 00:20:59.940
A freebie!

00:21:00.160 --> 00:21:01.400
Oh...

00:21:01.700 --> 00:21:02.740
What is this?

00:21:03.480 --> 00:21:05.070
You put it in your hair.

00:21:05.310 --> 00:21:06.460
Let me see.

00:21:07.860 --> 00:21:09.280
Hold still.

00:21:10.000 --> 00:21:12.000
There. It's done.

00:21:12.480 --> 00:21:14.400
Yeah, you look great!

00:21:14.400 --> 00:21:15.990
R-Really?

00:21:16.640 --> 00:21:20.130
Thank you...

00:21:20.800 --> 00:21:22.800
Huh? What's up?

00:21:22.800 --> 00:21:25.280
No... Nothing.

00:21:26.010 --> 00:21:27.120
Ruru-san!

00:21:27.120 --> 00:21:28.300
You're late!

00:21:28.590 --> 00:21:29.930
It's Ruru-chan!

00:21:29.930 --> 00:21:31.260
You look beautiful!

00:21:31.260 --> 00:21:32.560
Your kimono is so cute!

00:21:32.880 --> 00:21:34.080
You look beautiful.

00:21:34.080 --> 00:21:35.380
Yeah.

00:21:36.190 --> 00:21:38.810
Your hair accessory looks great, too.

00:22:41.880 --> 00:22:44.840
Very Good Luck

00:23:13.370 --> 00:23:17.040
<b>Gratitude</b>

00:23:13.840 --> 00:23:16.100
Sorry, Rurumo.

00:23:16.820 --> 00:23:19.820
I promised I'd help you finish your training.

00:23:17.040 --> 00:23:23.080
<b>May these fun times never end.
- Shibaki Kota</b>

00:23:21.260 --> 00:23:26.250
But I want to keep spending time with you...

00:23:35.010 --> 00:23:40.020
<b>Maji Moji 
Rurumo</b>

00:23:35.010 --> 00:23:40.020
<b>Thank you!!</b>

00:23:35.010 --> 00:23:40.020
Thank
 you.

00:23:35.010 --> 00:23:40.020
<b>Illustration by Watanabe Wataru</b>
